From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 13:10:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] media: mediatek: isp6s: camsv: Remove the video node with the
 subdev

The video node is created in the subdev's .registered() callback, once
SENINF's notifier binds the CAMSV into its V4L2 device, but was only
removed when the CAMSV driver itself went away. When SENINF unbound
first, the node stayed registered against a V4L2 device that was then
freed, and binding again would register the same video_device a second
time. Removing the CAMSV before it was ever bound unregistered a node
that had never been registered.

Remove the node in an .unregistered() callback, so that it follows the
subdev's registration, and let v4l2_async_unregister_subdev() trigger
it on driver removal.

Signed-off-by: Patrick Quinn <patrick.jm.quinn@gmail.com>
---
 camsv/mtk_camsv.c | 12 +++++++++---
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/camsv/mtk_camsv.c b/camsv/mtk_camsv.c
index eddb981..8337ca5 100644
--- a/camsv/mtk_camsv.c
+++ b/camsv/mtk_camsv.c
@@ -284,6 +284,13 @@ static int mtk_cam_subdev_registered(struct v4l2_subdev *sd)
 	return mtk_isp6s_camsv_video_register(cam);
 }
 
+static void mtk_cam_subdev_unregistered(struct v4l2_subdev *sd)
+{
+	struct mtk_cam_dev *cam = to_mtk_cam_dev(sd);
+
+	mtk_isp6s_camsv_video_unregister(&cam->vdev);
+}
+
 static const struct v4l2_subdev_video_ops mtk_cam_subdev_video_ops = {
 	.s_stream = mtk_cam_sd_s_stream,
 };
@@ -303,6 +310,7 @@ static const struct v4l2_subdev_ops mtk_cam_subdev_ops = {
 static const struct v4l2_subdev_internal_ops mtk_cam_internal_ops = {
 	.init_state = mtk_cam_init_cfg,
 	.registered = mtk_cam_subdev_registered,
+	.unregistered = mtk_cam_subdev_unregistered,
 };
 
 /* -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
@@ -398,10 +406,8 @@ fail_clean_media_entiy:
 
 static void mtk_cam_v4l2_unregister(struct mtk_cam_dev *cam)
 {
-	mtk_isp6s_camsv_video_unregister(&cam->vdev);
-
-	media_entity_cleanup(&cam->subdev.entity);
 	v4l2_async_unregister_subdev(&cam->subdev);
+	media_entity_cleanup(&cam->subdev.entity);
 }
 
 int mtk_isp6s_camsv_dev_init(struct mtk_cam_dev *cam_dev)
-- 
